  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing Social Entrepreneurship Ecosystem in Azerbaijan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social entrepreneurship (SE) ecosystem in Azerbaijan is nascent. Social enterprises are small/miro organisations, mainly involved in B2C trading on the local market. The government of Azerbaijan is working on a legal framework to promote social entreneurship based on the international good practices while giving due consideration to the local context. The local landscape misses other important elements of ecosystem building such as skills and systemic business support, access to funding, fiscal</narrative>
  </description>
